{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_37C4E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"有能炸掉路障的东西吗？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":34,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"没有……。还得看是什么样的路障，不过应该需要威力很大的炸药。\nMother Base那边不能想想办法吗？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":133,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"让研发班制造“C4炸药”怎么样？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"如果人手不够，恐怕还得想办法\n从别处招人……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"先确认一下Mother Base目前的状况吧，\nSnake。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""}]}